      "created_at": "2016-01-18T06:22:26.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>So I ran into a dilema in a game that I wasn't sure how to solve properly. We were in the Temple of Zhu'Long, and one of the shinobis went on top of Nightmist's deck. Nightmist used Mists of Time, and we weren't sure how that would interact, because the card says to switch her trash with her deck, not to discard it. I said that it wouldn't count as the Shinobi being discarded, but I wasn't actually sure.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>What do you guys think? Would it be counted as discarded or not?</p>",
